{
  "work_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae",
  "source_path": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae.json",
  "source_language": "chu",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-29",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "d7de67fe94dfcc21",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "March 11. The Life of Gregory, Pope of Rome. Blessed Gregory was appointed patriarch"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "2fabf484d8c29a23",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of God's holy Church in Rome. Before becoming patriarch, he was a monk in the monastery"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "317eb721501c6894",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of the holy apostle Andrew, called Clivus Scauri, near the holy martyrs"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "37f90ae598e6a24a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "John and Paul. He was the abbot of that monastery. His mother, blessed Silvia,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "6e62cd81713155cc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "lived near the gate of the holy apostle Paul, at a place called Cella Nova. This blessed Gregory,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "7366ccea8b67186d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "while he was sitting in his cell and writing, was visited by a poor man,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "71eb328edd342de7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "who begged him, saying, “Have mercy on me, servant of God Most High, for I was the captain of a ship,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "3f831d1785e83916",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and we were shipwrecked and lost much property, both our own and other people's.” The lover of the poor and true servant of Christ"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "0d8482ca22de1a19",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "called his attendant and said to him, “Brother, go and give this man six gold coins.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "3c9347ec723dd520",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The brother went and did as Gregory, the servant of God, had commanded him,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "5d7434350a032763",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and gave the poor man six gold coins, and he went away. Then, after waiting a little while, on that same day,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "f7387587a82fd454",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the same poor man came to blessed Gregory, saying, “Have mercy on me, servant of God Most High, for I have lost much,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "4ad9e0f46710749e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but you have given me little.” The blessed man called his attendant and said to him, “Go, brother, give him another six gold coins.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "4341e3f5d23c8ad2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The brother did so. The poor man took the twelve gold coins and went away."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "2df2d0a40697fb99",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "After waiting a little while again, he came to blessed Gregory for the third time that same day, saying,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "a9a6ff25b263ac1f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Have mercy on me, servant of God Most High. Give me another blessing, for I have lost much.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "9eacd51f3bd800e5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The blessed man called his attendant and said to him, “Go and give him another six gold coins.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "62067b1505c70438",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But he answered, saying, “Believe me, venerable father, there is not a single gold coin left in the treasury.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "4aaad0d839bcb7ed",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The blessed man said to him, “Do you not have some other vessel, or a garment, to give him?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "94c2bc01dda8e28b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He answered and said, “I have no other vessel, venerable father,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.61v.s14",
      "source_sha256": "c3b353c91c080b73",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "except the silver dish which the noble lady sent with beans.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "73fffacd2f681070",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Gregory, the servant of God, said to him, “Go, brother, give him that dish.” The brother did as the blessed man commanded him"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "ac6926d55b0ee6c5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and gave it to the poor man. The poor man took the twelve gold coins and the silver dish and went away."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "de0768fdce1a3c30",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When they appointed him patriarch of the holy Church in Rome, in accordance with patriarchal custom,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "28cd65dc24872aef",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he commanded his treasurer one day to bring twelve poor men together."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "4f389b130acbdcd5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to his table to dine with him. The treasurer did as the patriarch had commanded him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "7346b42137190085",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He invited twelve poor men. But when they sat down with the patriarch, there were found to be thirteen at the table."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "31ec26a48335cd29",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He summoned the treasurer and said to him, “Did I not tell you to invite twelve?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "0eb1dff6c3b7f41e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "How, then, have you invited thirteen without my command?” When the treasurer heard this,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "b4850233cfcd13c8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he was frightened and answered him, “Believe me, honored master,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "6d88fc03b3310ed9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "there are twelve of them.” No one could see the thirteenth except the patriarch alone."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "64c700465183304b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "As they dined, the patriarch could see the thirteenth man sitting at the end of the table."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "e71baa0347cd2c3c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And behold, his face changed its appearance: sometimes he looked like a gray-haired man, and sometimes like a youth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "d7c1ca2323455165",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When they rose from the table, the blessed man dismissed all the others, but the thirteenth man,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62r.s14",
      "source_sha256": "f2b694e8312f62c0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "whose appearance was so wondrous, he took by the hand and brought into his own room, saying"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "13247bf1665cf385",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to him, “I adjure you by the great power of God Almighty: tell me who you are"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "b22bfc1837b3d314",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and what your name is.” He said to him, “As for your asking my name,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "e50bc098700bb887",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that too is a wonder. But I am the poor man"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "133d75e340834b99",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "who came to you when you were in the monastery of the holy apostle Andrew, called Clivus Scauri,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "7893d66641d9aaff",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "when you were sitting in your cell writing, to whom you gave twelve gold coins"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "3f2c30d33f9c1356",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and the silver dish that your mother, the blessed Silvia, had sent you with some gruel."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "27c86e2d56294869",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And know that from that day when you gave to me with patience and a sincere heart,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "6e2ada831881e474",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the Lord appointed you to be patriarch of his holy Church, for which he shed his own blood,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "09ef6d89cc438417",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and to be the successor and representative of Peter, the chief apostle.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "cded7794621a7603",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The blessed Gregory said to him, “How do you know that the Lord then appointed me to be patriarch?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "676ad25f8a45d466",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He answered, “Is it not because I am an angel of the Lord Almighty?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "d20e66954e96decf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is why I know. For at that time the Lord had sent me to you to test your devotion:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "226b0741cd8dfab1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "whether you showed mercy out of love for humanity, and not to be seen by people.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.62v.s14",
      "source_sha256": "1c212b25f0bf4798",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When the blessed man heard this, he was afraid, for he had never seen an angel before. He had been speaking to him as to a man and looking"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.63r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "329fdfaacf53813b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "at him. The angel said to the blessed man, “Do not be afraid. Behold, the Lord has sent me to be with you throughout this life.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.63r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "f546ab22f33686fb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "When the blessed man heard this from the angel, he fell face down on the ground"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.63r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "50414cd054def871",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "and worshiped the Lord, saying: “If, for that small gift, insignificant as it is,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.63r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "1ab1a3669bcc0862",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "the most merciful Lord has shown me such abundant compassion as to send his angel to me"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.63r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "e734086fa624a99c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "to be with me always, what glory, then, will those who remain in his commandments be found worthy of,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.63r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "a60b3718893dd0c5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "and those who do what is right! For he who said, ‘Mercy triumphs over judgment,’ does not lie."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.63r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "cb82ede8f46ae207",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "And whoever has mercy on the poor lends to God. The Lord of angels himself, who provides for human salvation,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.63r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "c2c017c5eca2f92e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "says to those standing at his right hand: ‘Come, you who are blessed by my Father,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.63r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "a5d19c91f2eb3aee",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "receive the kingdom prepared for you from the beginning of the world. For I was hungry, and you gave me food."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.63r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "f3c43f9ca5bbeb25",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "I was thirsty, and you gave me drink. I was a stranger, and you took me in. I was sick, and you visited me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.63r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "1365f6c0c5332d4e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "I was naked, and you clothed me. I was in prison, and you came to me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.63r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "85361ff89102b550",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "Since you did this to one of these least of my brothers, you did it to me.’”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.63r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "443b83d1fda3b97f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "May all of us who read and listen be granted to hear that blessed voice."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.63r.s14",
      "source_sha256": "c9559c00aab7d674",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "And may we be made fellow sharers in the eternal blessings that God has prepared for those who love him"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.63v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "8cd32b69ac839f7c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "by Christ our God, for the sake of his most pure Mother, the holy Mother of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-gregorii-papae#Supr.63v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "4bb6927f83387782",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "For to him belong glory, honor, and worship, now and always and forever and ever. Amen."
    }
  ]
}
